<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n28077" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Mărōnēa</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Mărōnīa</span></b> , ae,
			f., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Μαρώνεια</span>. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>A town of Thrace, on the Schœneus, famous
				for its wine</i>, now <i>Marona</i>, <i><span class="en">Mel. 2, 2,
			8</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Liv. 31, 16, 3</span></i>; <i><span class="en">37, 60,
			7</span></i>.— Hence, <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Mărōnēus</span></b> , a,
			um, <i>adj., of Maronea</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vinum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					14, 4, 6, § 53</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Tib. 4, 1, 57</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>A town of the Samnites</i>, now <i>Campo Marano</i>, <i><span class="en">Liv. 27, 1, 1</span></i>.</div>
